      "description": "Watch Besiktas vs Eyüpspor highlights and goals from Süper Lig on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 16, 2026. The atmosphere was electric as Besiktas faced off against Eyüpspor in a pivotal Süper Lig encounter. On August 16, 2026, both sides stepped onto the pitch knowing that every tactical adjustment would be critical in a match defined by narrow margins and shifting momentum. Cerny Strikes Early The breakthrough arrived in the 25th minute, changing the complexion of the game instantly. Vaclav Cerny clinically finished an opportunity set up by Junior Olaitan , silencing the home crowd and putting the visiting side in the driver’s seat. For the remainder of the first half, the game became a tactical chess match as the hosts searched for an immediate response to the deficit. Survival Under Pressure The second half saw the intensity boil over, leading to a major turning point in the 68th minute when David Costa was shown his second yellow card, leaving Eyüpspor a man down. Despite the numerical disadvantage and a flurry of substitutions from both benches—including the introduction of Wilfred Ndidi and Milot Rashica —the visitors showcased immense defensive discipline. The final minutes were played with frantic urgency by the home side, but the resilient structure of the visitors ensured they weathered the storm until the final whistle."
